WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.410
A bath is filling from a tap.

2
00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:03.630
Watch the meter.

3
00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:08.700
The needle never settles: the flow
rate keeps changing as the bath fills.

4
00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.220
You know the flow rate at every moment.

5
00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:14.850
When the tap turns off, how
much water is in the bath?

6
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.050
In this mission, you'll learn integration,

7
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:22.400
which reverses differentiation, and
why it needs a constant of integration.

8
00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:25.500
You'll use a boundary condition,
a known point on the curve,

9
00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:27.320
to fix that constant.

10
00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:30.020
And you'll write definite
integrals, with their limits,

11
00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:32.820
before your GDC evaluates them.

12
00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:37.150
Your mission: work out how to find
how much water filled the bath.
